{"path":"/case-studies/dydx/","slug":"case-studies__dydx","kind":"case-study","title":"dYdX Case Study: Same-Day Support for a Market That Never Closes | Legency Media","description":"dYdX runs a decentralized crypto exchange. Its markets trade around the clock and its marketing calendar keeps the same hours: new campaigns, new incentives, new pages, all on fixed deadlines.","source":"live","stylesheets":["/_astro/global.Btqt_PqA.css","/_astro/Base.D9X9tJbq.css","/_astro/ConsentBanner.Bjqg_HPr.css","/_astro/_slug_.CjSPQXea.css"],"scripts":["/_astro/Nav.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BTi8Y4C0.js","/_astro/Footer.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.QLgbxcz6.js","/_astro/ConsentBanner.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BlWZOVqD.js","/_astro/Base.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BUtqXeGZ.js","/_astro/Base.astro_astro_type_script_index_1_lang.s69FG7Vr.js"],"mainHtml":"<section class=\"cs-hero\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"container cs-hero__grid\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"cs-hero__lead\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Case Study</span><span class=\"cs-hero__client\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><img class=\"cs-hero__logo\" src=\"/img/partners/dydx.svg\" alt=\"dYdX\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y></span><h1 class=\"cs-hero__title\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Same-Day Support for a Market That Never Closes</h1><aside class=\"side-card\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"side-card__top\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><h2 data-no-roll class=\"side-card__heading\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Our role</h2><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:44px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M5.21173 15.1113L2.52473 12.4243C2.29041 12.1899 2.29041 11.8101 2.52473 11.5757L5.21173 8.88873C5.44605 8.65442 5.82595 8.65442 6.06026 8.88873L8.74727 11.5757C8.98158 11.8101 8.98158 12.1899 8.74727 12.4243L6.06026 15.1113C5.82595 15.3456 5.44605 15.3456 5.21173 15.1113Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 21.475L8.88874 18.788C8.65443 18.5537 8.65443 18.1738 8.88874 17.9395L11.5757 15.2525C11.8101 15.0182 12.19 15.0182 12.4243 15.2525L15.1113 17.9395C15.3456 18.1738 15.3456 18.5537 15.1113 18.788L12.4243 21.475C12.19 21.7094 11.8101 21.7094 11.5757 21.475Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 8.7475L8.88874 6.06049C8.65443 5.82618 8.65443 5.44628 8.88874 5.21197L11.5757 2.52496C11.8101 2.29065 12.19 2.29065 12.4243 2.52496L15.1113 5.21197C15.3456 5.44628 15.3456 5.82618 15.1113 6.06049L12.4243 8.7475C12.19 8.98181 11.8101 8.98181 11.5757 8.7475Z\"/><path d=\"M17.9396 15.1113L15.2526 12.4243C15.0183 12.1899 15.0183 11.8101 15.2526 11.5757L17.9396 8.88873C18.174 8.65442 18.5539 8.65442 18.7882 8.88873L21.4752 11.5757C21.7095 11.8101 21.7095 12.1899 21.4752 12.4243L18.7882 15.1113C18.5539 15.3456 18.174 15.3456 17.9396 15.1113Z\"/></svg></span></div><p class=\"side-card__text\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Campaign page development, website updates and testing support for the dYdX marketing team.</p></aside></div><figure class=\"cs-hero__media\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><img class=\"case-visual\" src=\"/img/case-studies/dydx-photo-1440.webp\" srcset=\"/img/case-studies/dydx-photo-800.webp 800w, /img/case-studies/dydx-photo-1440.webp 1440w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 900px) 94vw, 45vw\" alt=\"dYdX homepage on a dark MacBook on blackened steel under directional light.\" width=\"1440\" height=\"1008\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" data-astro-cid-iavcwzwr><figcaption data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>dYdX. Webflow maintenance, campaign pages and testing support.</figcaption></figure></div></section><section class=\"challenge\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"container challenge__grid\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>The Challenge</span><h2 data-no-roll class=\"challenge__title\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>When your agency moves slower than the market.</h2></div><div class=\"challenge__text\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><p data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>dYdX runs a decentralized crypto exchange. Its markets trade around the clock and its marketing calendar keeps the same hours: new campaigns, new incentives, new pages, all on fixed deadlines.</p><p data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>The previous Webflow agency could not keep up. Simple requests took too long, basic work carried heavy process, and the team was left waiting on answers it needed that day.</p><p data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>dYdX moved its Webflow development to us in 2025. The brief was website support that runs at the speed its own market does.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"solution section\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"container solution__grid\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"solution__lead\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>The Solution</span><h2 data-no-roll class=\"solution__title\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Webflow support at trading speed.</h2></div><div class=\"solution__cards\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><article class=\"sol-card\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"sol-card__top\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><h3 class=\"sol-card__heading\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Slack-Native, No Layers</h3><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:44px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M17 12.5C17.2761 12.5 17.5 12.2761 17.5 12C17.5 11.7239 17.2761 11.5 17 11.5C16.7239 11.5 16.5 11.7239 16.5 12C16.5 12.2761 16.7239 12.5 17 12.5Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M12 12.5C12.2761 12.5 12.5 12.2761 12.5 12C12.5 11.7239 12.2761 11.5 12 11.5C11.7239 11.5 11.5 11.7239 11.5 12C11.5 12.2761 11.7239 12.5 12 12.5Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M7 12.5C7.27614 12.5 7.5 12.2761 7.5 12C7.5 11.7239 7.27614 11.5 7 11.5C6.72386 11.5 6.5 11.7239 6.5 12C6.5 12.2761 6.72386 12.5 7 12.5Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M12 22C17.5228 22 22 17.5228 22 12C22 6.47715 17.5228 2 12 2C6.47715 2 2 6.47715 2 12C2 13.8214 2.48697 15.5291 3.33782 17L2.5 21.5L7 20.6622C8.47087 21.513 10.1786 22 12 22Z\"/></svg></span></div><p class=\"sol-card__text\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Direct Slack access to the person doing the build. No tickets, no account managers, no relay. Standard requests are answered within one business day, and urgent work is turned around the same day.</p></article><article class=\"sol-card\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"sol-card__top\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><h3 class=\"sol-card__heading\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>A Standing A/B Testing Programme</h3><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:44px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M18.5 15L5.5 15\"/><path d=\"M16 4L8 4\"/><path d=\"M9 4.5L9 10.2602C9 10.7376 8.82922 11.1992 8.51851 11.5617L3.48149 17.4383C3.17078 17.8008 3 18.2624 3 18.7398V19C3 20.1046 3.89543 21 5 21L19 21C20.1046 21 21 20.1046 21 19V18.7398C21 18.2624 20.8292 17.8008 20.5185 17.4383L15.4815 11.5617C15.1708 11.1992 15 10.7376 15 10.2602L15 4.5\"/><path d=\"M12 9.01L12.01 8.99889\"/><path d=\"M11 2.01L11.01 1.99889\"/></svg></span></div><p class=\"sol-card__text\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Split-testing runs through Webflow Optimize at two to three tests a month, one section at a time. Test design, build and deployment, monitoring while the test runs, reporting on the outcome, and a recommendation on what to test next.</p></article><article class=\"sol-card\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"sol-card__top\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><h3 class=\"sol-card__heading\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Claim Pages That Run Themselves</h3><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:44px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M8.5 11.5L11.5 14.5L16.5 9.5\"/><path d=\"M5 18L3.13036 4.91253C3.05646 4.39524 3.39389 3.91247 3.90398 3.79912L11.5661 2.09641C11.8519 2.03291 12.1481 2.03291 12.4339 2.09641L20.096 3.79912C20.6061 3.91247 20.9435 4.39524 20.8696 4.91252L19 18C18.9293 18.495 18.5 21.5 12 21.5C5.5 21.5 5.07071 18.495 5 18Z\"/></svg></span></div><p class=\"sol-card__text\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Each trading competition gets its own rewards claim page. A trader enters a wallet address, the page checks it against that campaign&#39;s current reward data, and returns an instant eligibility answer with the amount or a clear message if the wallet does not qualify. Every claim is logged automatically.</p></article></div></div></section><section class=\"outcome\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"outcome__head\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><span class=\"label label--on-dark\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>The Outcome</span><h2 data-no-roll class=\"outcome__title\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>A partnership that keeps going.</h2></div><div class=\"outcome__grid\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><article class=\"out-card\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"out-card__top\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><h3 class=\"out-card__heading\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Working Together Since 2025</h3><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:44px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M1 20V19C1 15.134 4.13401 12 8 12V12C11.866 12 15 15.134 15 19V20\"/><path d=\"M13 14V14C13 11.2386 15.2386 9 18 9V9C20.7614 9 23 11.2386 23 14V14.5\"/><path d=\"M8 12C10.2091 12 12 10.2091 12 8C12 5.79086 10.2091 4 8 4C5.79086 4 4 5.79086 4 8C4 10.2091 5.79086 12 8 12Z\"/><path d=\"M18 9C19.6569 9 21 7.65685 21 6C21 4.34315 19.6569 3 18 3C16.3431 3 15 4.34315 15 6C15 7.65685 16.3431 9 18 9Z\"/></svg></span></div><p class=\"out-card__text\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>dYdX moved its Webflow development to us in 2025 and the work has run continuously since, through campaign after campaign, with no account layer in between.</p></article><article class=\"out-card\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"out-card__top\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><h3 class=\"out-card__heading\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Same-Day on the Urgent Work</h3><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:44px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M13 10V3L5 14H11V21L19 10H13Z\"/></svg></span></div><p class=\"out-card__text\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Urgent fixes and updates are turned around the same day, handled directly in Slack by the person doing the build. The team asks once and the work moves.</p></article><article class=\"out-card\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"out-card__top\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><h3 class=\"out-card__heading\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>A Steady Testing Rhythm</h3><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:44px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M18.5 15L5.5 15\"/><path d=\"M16 4L8 4\"/><path d=\"M9 4.5L9 10.2602C9 10.7376 8.82922 11.1992 8.51851 11.5617L3.48149 17.4383C3.17078 17.8008 3 18.2624 3 18.7398V19C3 20.1046 3.89543 21 5 21L19 21C20.1046 21 21 20.1046 21 19V18.7398C21 18.2624 20.8292 17.8008 20.5185 17.4383L15.4815 11.5617C15.1708 11.1992 15 10.7376 15 10.2602L15 4.5\"/><path d=\"M12 9.01L12.01 8.99889\"/><path d=\"M11 2.01L11.01 1.99889\"/></svg></span></div><p class=\"out-card__text\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Split-testing runs as a standing programme with a regular cycle of tests, results and next recommendations, so the team always knows what to try on the page next.</p></article><article class=\"out-card\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"out-card__top\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><h3 class=\"out-card__heading\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Campaign Infrastructure That Scales</h3><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:44px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M9 9L4 4M4 4V8M4 4H8\"/><path d=\"M15 9L20 4M20 4V8M20 4H16\"/><path d=\"M9 15L4 20M4 20V16M4 20H8\"/><path d=\"M15 15L20 20M20 20V16M20 20H16\"/></svg></span></div><p class=\"out-card__text\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Every new competition reuses the same self-serve claim pattern: build the page, point it at that campaign&#39;s own data, ship to staging first. Week-by-week sprint updates are a data change rather than a rebuild, and each campaign stays isolated so competitions never cross.</p></article></div></div></section>","inlineStyles":[".transition {\n          display: none;\n        }",".cs-hero .label,.challenge .label,.solution .label,.work-hero .label{color:#625e5e}.site-footer .closer__scene{filter:grayscale()}.case-visual[data-astro-cid-iavcwzwr]{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}\n.icon-chip[data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga]{width:var(--icon-chip-size,48px);height:var(--icon-chip-size,48px);background:var(--blue);color:var(--white);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);flex-shrink:0;place-items:center;display:grid}.icon-chip--on-dark[data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga]{background:#ffffff1a;border:1px solid #ffffff47}.icon-chip--bare[data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga]{color:inherit;background:0 0;border:0}.icon-chip--muted[data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga]{color:#201d1d8c;background:#201d1d0f;border:1px solid #201d1d1a}.icon-chip[data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga] svg[data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga]{width:58%;height:58%;display:block}.icon-chip--bare[data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga] svg[data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga]{width:100%;height:100%}","html.lenis,html.lenis body{height:auto}.lenis:not(.lenis-autoToggle).lenis-stopped{overflow:clip}.lenis [data-lenis-prevent],.lenis [data-lenis-prevent-wheel],.lenis [data-lenis-prevent-touch],.lenis [data-lenis-prevent-vertical],.lenis [data-lenis-prevent-horizontal]{overscroll-behavior:contain}.lenis.lenis-smooth iframe{pointer-events:none}.lenis.lenis-autoToggle{transition-behavior:allow-discrete;transition-property:overflow;transition-duration:1ms}"]}